The SuperEmbedder release distributes a converted form of the following model,
as the release downloads qwen3-embedding-0.6b-1p5.sslm (model) and
qwen3-embedding-0.6b-tokenizer.sslm (tokenizer). The source code in this repository does
not contain the model's weights.

Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
Revision: 97b0c614be4d77ee51c0cef4e5f07c00f9eb65b3
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
You may obtain a copy of the License at
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Modifications: the model's weights were converted to the SuperSLM integer
format by SuperSLM's offline converter, and its tokenizer to SuperSLM's
tokenizer format. The conversion changes the numeric representation of the
weights; it adds no weights and no training.
